    MouParagraph('4.5 The Aggregator shall maintain entrusted inventory in a safe, secure, clean and suitable environment; take reasonable precautions against theft, loss, damage, deterioration, misuse and unauthorized access; immediately report incidents; permit reasonable inspections/audits; maintain accurate inventory records; and return inventory immediately upon authorized request.'),
    MouParagraph('4.6 The Aggregator shall be responsible for loss or damage arising from its negligence, wilful misconduct, unauthorized use, misuse, or failure to exercise reasonable care.'),
