    MouHeading('7. SECURITY DEPOSIT, FORFEITURE AND AGGREGATOR LIABILITY'),
    MouParagraph('7.1 Before taking possession of an artwork for display, the Aggregator shall pay an amount equivalent to five percent (5%) of the applicable artwork value as a security deposit/advance, together with applicable delivery, transportation or logistics charges.'),
    MouParagraph('7.2 The security deposit/advance secures the Aggregator’s obligations to properly receive, handle, display, safeguard and return the artwork. It is not a purchase and does not transfer ownership.'),
    MouParagraph('7.3 Upon successful sale, the applicable security deposit may be adjusted or otherwise settled through Galleryzone’s settlement process.'),
    MouParagraph('7.4 If an artwork remains unsold and is returned in the required condition, the security deposit shall be refundable or adjustable, subject to lawful deductions expressly permitted under this MOU.'),
    MouParagraph('7.5 Galleryzone may forfeit the security deposit, in whole or in part, where the Aggregator fails to return an artwork; loses, misplaces or permits unauthorized removal; causes damage through negligence or wilful misconduct; deals with artwork outside the platform without authorization; materially breaches custody/security/handling obligations; refuses inspection/return/reconciliation; abandons artwork; or fails to comply with reasonable instructions.'),
    MouParagraph('7.6 In the event of damage or loss, the deposit may be applied toward reasonable repair, restoration, replacement, recovery, transportation and directly related expenses.'),
    MouParagraph('7.7 The security deposit is security only and shall NOT constitute a maximum liability or liability cap. If loss, theft, destruction or damage attributable to the Aggregator exceeds the deposit, the Aggregator remains liable for the balance properly recoverable under this MOU and applicable law.'),
    MouParagraph('7.8 Where an artwork is lost, stolen, destroyed, or damaged beyond economical repair while in the Aggregator’s custody or control due to circumstances attributable to the Aggregator, and the loss is not fully covered or recovered through applicable insurance or another responsible third party, the Aggregator shall pay Galleryzone an amount equal to the full Artist Price/quoted value of the affected artwork.'),
    MouParagraph('7.9 If insurance coverage is rejected, reduced, invalidated or otherwise fails to compensate the full loss because of an act, omission, negligence, inadequate documentation, failure to comply with insurance requirements, or other conduct attributable to the Aggregator, the Aggregator remains liable for the uninsured or unrecovered portion.'),
    MouParagraph('7.10 In a loss or material damage event attributable to the Aggregator, the security deposit shall not be refundable until the applicable loss and liabilities are fully reconciled. Galleryzone may first apply/forfeit the deposit and then recover any remaining amount.'),
    MouParagraph('7.11 In addition to the Artist Price/quoted value where applicable, the Aggregator shall be responsible, to the extent legally recoverable, for reasonable directly attributable recovery, inspection, restoration, replacement, transportation, insurance-related and legal recovery costs.'),
    MouParagraph('7.12 Where responsibility is shared, liability shall be apportioned according to the actual responsibility established on the available evidence and applicable law.'),
    MouParagraph('7.13 Any forfeiture or deduction shall be communicated with reasonable details of the relevant loss, damage, expense or breach.'),
    MouParagraph('7.14 Delivery, transportation, logistics and handling charges paid by the Aggregator for an unsold artwork shall be non-refundable unless Galleryzone expressly agrees otherwise in writing.'),
    MouHeading('8. TAXES AND REGULATORY COMPLIANCE'),
    MouParagraph('8.1 The final customer-facing Listed Selling Price shall be displayed inclusive of applicable taxes wherever required by law and Galleryzone’s billing system.'),
