    MouParagraph('18.5 The award shall be final and binding subject to applicable law.'),
    MouParagraph('18.6 Either party may seek urgent interim/protective/injunctive relief from a competent court. Courts at Hyderabad shall have jurisdiction over such applications and enforcement.'),
    MouParagraph('18.7 Arbitration proceedings and related documents shall be treated as confidential except as required for enforcement, legal compliance or professional advice.'),
    MouHeading('19. FORCE MAJEURE'),
    MouParagraph('19.1 Neither party shall be liable for delay/failure to perform to the extent caused by circumstances beyond reasonable control, including natural disasters, fire, flood, epidemic/pandemic, war, terrorism, civil disturbance, governmental action, strikes, major logistics disruption, widespread telecommunications/internet failure, cyber incidents, utility failure or material third-party infrastructure failure.'),
    MouParagraph('19.2 The affected party shall use reasonable efforts to mitigate the effect and resume performance as soon as practicable.'),
    MouParagraph('19.3 Force majeure shall not excuse payment obligations already due, ownership obligations for artwork already sold, or obligations intended to survive.'),
    MouParagraph('19.4 If the event materially prevents performance for more than sixty (60) consecutive days, either party may request termination of the affected arrangement subject to settlement of accrued rights and obligations.'),
