    MouParagraph('21.7 Galleryzone’s then-current privacy policy and legally required notices form part of the privacy framework, subject to mandatory law.'),
    MouHeading('22. INDEMNIFICATION'),
    MouParagraph('22.1 The Aggregator shall indemnify and hold harmless Galleryzone, its directors, officers, employees and authorized service providers from third-party claims, losses, liabilities, penalties, reasonable costs and expenses arising from or relating to: breach of this MOU; unauthorized sale/transfer or misuse of artwork; loss or damage attributable to the Aggregator; infringement of third-party rights caused by the Aggregator’s acts; false or misleading information/documents supplied by the Aggregator; unlawful conduct attributable to the Aggregator; or taxes/statutory liabilities attributable to the Aggregator’s acts or omissions.'),
    MouParagraph('22.2 Galleryzone remains responsible for liabilities that cannot lawfully be transferred and for loss directly caused by Galleryzone’s proven fraud, wilful misconduct or negligence, subject to this MOU and applicable law.'),
    MouParagraph('22.3 The indemnified party shall, where reasonably practicable, provide notice and reasonable cooperation in defence. No settlement imposing an admission or continuing obligation on the indemnified party shall be entered without its consent, not to be unreasonably withheld.'),
    MouHeading('23. NOTICES'),
