    MouParagraph('23.3 Email notice shall be treated as received when transmitted without delivery failure, subject to law. Physical notice shall be treated as received upon delivery or attempted delivery in accordance with law.'),
    MouParagraph('23.4 Each party shall promptly notify changes to contact details.'),
    MouHeading('24. ELECTRONIC EXECUTION AND RECORDS'),
    MouParagraph('24.1 This MOU may be executed and accepted electronically, including electronic signatures, digital signatures, electronic acceptance or other legally valid means.'),
    MouParagraph('24.2 Galleryzone may maintain electronic records of the accepted version, date/time, authentication/verification records and related audit information, subject to law.'),
    MouParagraph('24.3 Electronic copies and records maintained in the ordinary course may be used as evidence of acceptance and execution, subject to law.'),
    MouHeading('25. COMPLIANCE WITH APPLICABLE LAWS'),
    MouParagraph('25.1 Each party shall comply with laws and regulations relevant to its obligations.'),
    MouParagraph('25.2 The Aggregator shall provide accurate KYC, tax, ownership, authorization and other information reasonably required for lawful onboarding and transactions.'),
    MouParagraph('25.3 The Aggregator shall not submit, handle, display or sell artwork or materials that are unlawful, counterfeit, infringing, misleading, fraudulent or otherwise prohibited by applicable law.'),
    MouParagraph('25.4 Galleryzone may suspend, restrict, hold, delist or terminate an artwork/account where reasonably necessary for law, regulatory direction, fraud prevention or material compliance obligations, subject to law.'),
    MouHeading('26. TAX, GST AND STATUTORY DEDUCTIONS'),
    MouParagraph('26.1 Each party is responsible for taxes imposed on it by law in relation to its income, activities and obligations.'),
    MouParagraph('26.2 The Aggregator shall provide accurate GST, PAN, tax residency and other tax information where required.'),
    MouParagraph('26.3 Galleryzone may deduct or withhold amounts required by law, including GST, TDS, TCS or other statutory deductions, and provide relevant records where legally required.'),
    MouParagraph('26.4 Tax treatment may vary by transaction structure, channel, location of supply and applicable law; parties shall cooperate with reasonable documentation.'),
    MouParagraph('26.5 If incorrect tax information supplied by the Aggregator results in additional liability, interest, penalty or loss attributable to that information, the Aggregator shall be responsible to the extent permitted by law.'),
    MouHeading('27. RETURNS, REFUNDS, CANCELLATIONS AND PAYMENT REVERSALS'),
    MouParagraph('27.1 Buyer returns, refunds, cancellations and failed deliveries shall be handled under applicable Galleryzone buyer/return/refund policies and law.'),
