    MouParagraph('27.4 Responsibility for return shipping, return damage, customer-caused damage and other return-related costs shall be determined under applicable transaction terms, insurance, logistics arrangements and law.'),
    MouHeading('28. WALLET AND SETTLEMENT LEDGER'),
    MouParagraph('28.1 Any Galleryzone wallet/account balance is an internal transaction and settlement ledger recording amounts payable, receivable, deductions and adjustments.'),
    MouParagraph('28.2 The wallet is not a deposit, bank account, payment instrument or regulated financial product unless expressly established in accordance with law.'),
    MouParagraph('28.3 Galleryzone may record legitimate deductions, refunds, chargebacks, logistics costs, insurance charges, taxes and other permitted amounts.'),
    MouParagraph('28.4 The Aggregator may raise a written reconciliation query within a reasonable period after receiving a settlement statement.'),
    MouHeading('29. INDEPENDENT RELATIONSHIP; NO PARTNERSHIP OR AGENCY'),
    MouParagraph('29.1 The parties are independent contracting parties. Nothing creates partnership, joint venture, employment or general agency.'),
    MouParagraph('29.2 Neither party may bind the other except where expressly authorized in writing.'),
    MouParagraph('29.3 Galleryzone may act as marketplace, facilitator or authorized intermediary only to the extent described in this MOU, transaction terms or applicable law.'),
    MouHeading('30. THIRD-PARTY SERVICE PROVIDERS AND SUBCONTRACTING'),
    MouParagraph('30.1 Galleryzone may use authorized third-party providers for technology, hosting, verification, KYC, payment processing, logistics, insurance, marketing, customer support, exhibitions, storage and related functions.'),
    MouParagraph('30.2 The Aggregator authorizes Galleryzone to share information reasonably necessary for such services, subject to applicable law.'),
    MouParagraph('30.3 Galleryzone may appoint or change service providers where reasonably necessary for business or compliance purposes.'),
    MouHeading('31. ASSIGNMENT'),
    MouParagraph('31.1 The Aggregator shall not assign or transfer this MOU or material rights without Galleryzone’s prior written consent, except where prohibited by law.'),
    MouParagraph('31.2 Galleryzone may assign or transfer this MOU to an affiliate, successor, purchaser of substantially all relevant business/assets, or other lawful successor, provided the assignment does not unlawfully prejudice accrued rights of the Aggregator.'),
    MouHeading('32. WAIVER; CUMULATIVE REMEDIES'),
    MouParagraph('32.1 Failure or delay in exercising a right or remedy shall not constitute waiver.'),
    MouParagraph('32.2 Rights and remedies under this MOU are cumulative and, subject to law, are in addition to other available rights and remedies.'),
    MouHeading('33. AGGREGATOR CAPACITY AND AUTHORITY'),
    MouParagraph('33.1 The Aggregator represents that it has legal capacity and authority to enter into and perform this MOU.'),
    MouParagraph('33.2 The Aggregator shall not knowingly submit or handle artwork subject to a conflicting ownership, licensing, consignment, security, contractual or other restriction that prevents the activities contemplated by this MOU.'),
    MouParagraph('33.3 Where acting through a representative, entity or authorized person, appropriate authority documentation shall be provided where reasonably required.'),
    MouHeading('34. RISK OF LOSS AND CONDITION'),
    MouParagraph('34.1 Ownership and risk of physical loss/damage are separate concepts. Risk shall be allocated according to the applicable custody, logistics and insurance arrangements.'),
    MouParagraph('34.2 The Aggregator shall disclose known pre-existing damage, defects, restoration, alteration or material condition issues.'),
    MouParagraph('34.3 Galleryzone or an authorized Aggregator may inspect and document condition by photographs, videos or condition reports before dispatch, during custody or before delivery.'),
    MouParagraph('34.4 Parties shall cooperate with logistics providers and insurers in relation to damage or loss.'),
    MouHeading('35. AGGREGATOR CUSTODY, ACCOUNTABILITY AND RECONCILIATION'),
    MouParagraph('35.1 From physical delivery, collection or placement under the Aggregator’s control until confirmed return to Galleryzone, the Artist or an authorized location, the Aggregator shall maintain the artwork in accordance with this MOU.'),
    MouParagraph('35.2 The security deposit shall not be treated as a substitute for custody, safeguarding, return, insurance or financial obligations.'),
    MouParagraph('35.3 The Aggregator shall maintain accurate records of each artwork, including artwork ID, Artist Price, receipt date, condition, location, display status, movement, sale status and return status.'),
    MouParagraph('35.4 Loss, theft, disappearance, damage, unauthorized movement, customer-caused incident, insurance incident or other material event shall be reported immediately.'),
    MouParagraph('35.5 If an artwork cannot be accounted for within the required return period, the Aggregator shall be responsible unless it establishes through reasonable documentary evidence that the loss was caused by circumstances for which it is not legally responsible.'),
    MouParagraph('35.6 Where the Aggregator is responsible for an artwork becoming lost or irrecoverable and the loss is not fully recovered through applicable insurance or another responsible third party, the Aggregator shall pay the full Artist Price/quoted value in accordance with Clause 7, without prejudice to other rights and remedies.'),
    MouParagraph('35.7 Payment for loss or damage does not transfer copyright or other intellectual-property rights in the artwork to the Aggregator.'),
    MouHeading('36. POST-TERMINATION EFFECTS AND RECORD RETENTION'),
    MouParagraph('36.1 Termination does not affect accrued rights or obligations.'),
    MouParagraph('36.2 Galleryzone may retain transaction, tax, accounting, authenticity, provenance, ownership, dispute, fraud-prevention and other records for periods reasonably required by law or legitimate business purposes.'),
    MouParagraph('36.3 Following termination, Galleryzone shall cease new marketing/listing activities where required by applicable withdrawal/termination terms, except for historical records, sold-artwork provenance, transaction records and legally required records.'),
    MouParagraph('36.4 Provisions concerning confidentiality, data protection, intellectual property, payment obligations, indemnity, liability, dispute resolution, record retention and other provisions intended by nature to survive shall survive termination.'),
    MouHeading('37. ORDER OF PRECEDENCE AND POLICIES'),
    MouParagraph('37.1 In case of conflict, the following order applies unless expressly stated otherwise: (a) mandatory applicable law; (b) this signed MOU and signed amendments; (c) transaction-specific written terms accepted by the parties; and (d) applicable operational policies published by Galleryzone.'),
    MouParagraph('37.2 Operational policies may supplement procedures and requirements but shall not materially amend core commercial rights and obligations unless amended in accordance with this MOU or otherwise expressly permitted by law.'),
    MouHeading('38. LANGUAGE AND INTERPRETATION'),
    MouParagraph('38.1 This MOU is executed in English. If a translation is provided for convenience, the English version shall prevail to the extent permitted by law.'),
    MouParagraph('38.2 Headings are for convenience only and shall not affect interpretation.'),
    MouHeading('39. SEVERABILITY'),
    MouParagraph('39.1 If any provision is held invalid, illegal or unenforceable by a competent authority, that provision shall be enforced to the maximum extent permitted by law and the remaining provisions shall continue in force.'),
    MouParagraph('39.2 The parties shall, where reasonably practicable, cooperate to replace an unenforceable provision with a lawful provision that most closely reflects the original commercial intent.'),
    MouHeading('40. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY'),
    MouParagraph('40.1 Except to the extent prohibited by applicable law, neither party shall be liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential loss arising solely from a remote or unforeseeable event.'),
    MouParagraph('40.2 Nothing in this Clause limits or excludes liability that cannot lawfully be limited or excluded.'),
    MouParagraph('40.3 In particular, nothing in this Clause shall limit the Aggregator’s liability for loss, theft, destruction or damage to artwork attributable to the Aggregator, unauthorized sale or transfer, conversion or misappropriation, fraud, wilful misconduct, gross negligence, breach of confidentiality, infringement caused by the Aggregator, or the Aggregator’s obligation under Clause 7 to pay the full Artist Price/quoted value where the applicable conditions are met.'),
    MouParagraph('40.4 The security deposit is not a liability cap. Any general liability limitation shall not be interpreted to reduce the specific inventory-loss and custody obligations expressly stated in this MOU.'),
    MouHeading('SIGNATURES'),
    MouParagraph('The parties confirm that they have read, understood and agreed to the terms of this MOU and intend to be legally bound by it, subject to applicable law.'),
    MouSigner('FOR GALLERYZONE PRIVATE LIMITED'),
    MouField('Name', MouFieldKey.companyName),
    MouField('Designation', MouFieldKey.companyDesignation),
    MouField('Signature', MouFieldKey.companySignature),
    MouField('Date', MouFieldKey.companyDate),
    MouSigner('FOR AUTHORIZED ART PARTNER / AGGREGATOR'),
    MouField('Name', MouFieldKey.partyName),
    MouField('Business Name', MouFieldKey.partyBusinessName),
    MouField('Signature', MouFieldKey.partySignature),
    MouField('Date', MouFieldKey.partyDate),
    MouNote('LEGAL REVIEW NOTE: This consolidated draft is prepared from the existing Galleryzone Aggregator MOU and the additional provisions requested. It should be reviewed and finalized by Galleryzone’s Indian legal counsel before execution, particularly the provisions concerning arbitration, data protection, tax, indemnification, insurance, liability, electronic execution and enforceability.'),
  ],
